<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= hotel.nombre %> - Iniciar Sesión</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f6f2ea; --surface: #ffffff; --border: #e3dac7; --text: #2b2620; --text-muted: #78705f;
      --primary: #1f4d3a; --primary-strong: #163a2b;
      --danger: #af4632; --danger-soft: #f7e6e1;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; }

    .brand-panel {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 460px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #f3efe6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 3rem;
    }
    .brand-panel .mark { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .brand-panel .mark i { font-size: 1.3rem; }
    .brand-panel h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 2.1rem; line-height: 1.2; max-width: 380px; }
    .brand-panel p.tagline { color: #d9e2da; font-size: 0.98rem; margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 360px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .brand-panel .features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .brand-panel .features .feat { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; color: #e3e9e2; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .brand-panel .features .feat .ico { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }

    .form-panel { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem; }
    .form-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; }
    .form-wrap .eyebrow { color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .form-wrap h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .form-wrap p.sub { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }

    .field { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
    .field label { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .field .input-wrap { position: relative; }
    .field .input-wrap i { position: absolute; left: 0.95rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .field input {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.85rem 2.6rem; min-height: 48px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: inherit;
      transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }
    .field input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 15%, transparent); }

    .btn-submit {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; min-height: 48px;
      background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover { background: var(--primary-strong); }

    .alert { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; background: var(--danger-soft); color: var(--danger); padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.87rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .hint { text-align: center; margin-top: 1.75rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg); border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.6rem; }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      body { flex-direction: column; }
      .brand-panel { flex: none; max-width: none; padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; min-height: auto; }
      .brand-panel .features { display: none; }
      .brand-panel h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
      .brand-panel p.tagline { display: none; }
      .form-panel { padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="brand-panel">
    <div>
      <div class="mark"><i class="fas fa-hotel"></i></div>
      <h1><%= hotel.nombre %></h1>
      <p class="tagline">Gestiona tus huéspedes, habitaciones, reservas y facturación en un solo lugar — rápido, claro y siempre a la mano.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feat"><div class="ico"><i class="fas fa-id-card"></i></div> Escaneo de cédula con autocompletado</div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="ico"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div> Check-in en un solo paso</div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="ico"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i></div> Reportes y ocupación en tiempo real</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-panel">
    <div class="form-wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Bienvenido de vuelta</div>
      <h2>Inicia sesión</h2>
      <p class="sub">Ingresa tus credenciales para continuar</p>

      <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
        <div class="alert"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> <%= error %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Usuario</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
            <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="admin" required autofocus>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Contraseña</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right-to-bracket"></i> Iniciar Sesión</button>
      </form>

      <% if (!isProd) { %>
      <div class="hint">Usuario: <strong>admin</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Contraseña: <strong>admin123</strong></div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
